Network Report mails a readable summary of the network on a schedule:
internet volume, connection quality, DNS blocking, security alerts,
devices and firewall health, in Arabic or English.

Any number of schedules can be defined (daily, selected weekdays or a
day of the month) with their own time, period, language, sections and
recipients. Reports can be previewed and sent from the GUI, a history
of sent reports is kept, and an alert is mailed when a new device
joins the local network.

